{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 对人物动摇的具体原因交代不如 Y 充分，尤其 S06–S07 对孤独感如何改变他对离开的看法，以及 S10–S11 为什么不愿回去，Y 的因果解释更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 采用话语与感受交替的方式，重点有明确的视觉落点，感受又能在音乐对应位置出现，观众比较容易边听边扫，抓住每段发生了什么。Y 的叙述在人物动机和心理因果上更充分，但右栏在 S03、S06、S07、S13 等段落堆积了大量短词，缺少清楚的先后关系和音乐对应，容易让观众来不及消化。X 的感受描写也更能落到具体的身体反应、声音质感和心理变化上，整首曲子的情绪推进更容易被感受到；代价是部分人物心理转折需要观众自己补足。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "68022329-90a8-4546-838e-4fd6a9b79582", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T021818671878Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:18:53.366332+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1ccabfdfe237401f96140ceaa0060708334b2a5d3381bf8525557237ee0f065c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9